      "value": "I am seeing this in my little group too. Not related to friending myself though.\n\nCounter says I have 28 members, but when I scrolls through all of them, two of the members appear twice after I press the button to see more members.\n\nWould be much easier to figure out if the Group members list was sorted alphabetically.\n\nEdit: Found a better bug report for my issue. Here: https://feedback.vrchat.com/website/p/load-more-members-loads-duplicates",
